lse,"text":"The protagonist was one of them and the favourite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After saving money earned from compensated dating, went to join an university. Simultaneously, stopped engaging in compensated dating."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Met with Protagonist's son, Naotaka in the university's tennis club, started getting along and developed into a relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Furthermore, since sexual compatibility was good, also married at the same time as university graduation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ran with Naotaka because her mother-in law started pressuring them to have children soon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ended up living in the protagonist's house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51072"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f23d8c023164c8660ac29a4d1dc0bb17f2c4117fa199c2c4a322207727aaab9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bc64d9bb664fc1bb5a9f748937ed3413303b1697edbc9439696a34eb16ff7d9.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鶴屋 春人","creatorId":"vndb:s986","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s986","name":"尾崎 未來","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70688","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61902","characterName":"城嶋 義之","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61902"},"originalCharacterName":"城嶋 義之","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist of the game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elite office worker, who works for a listed company with the position of department manager."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has divorced his wife about 10 years ago and now lives alone in an apartment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After divorce, in a moment of loneliness and desiring company, started engaging with dating websites and sexual industry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Around that time, met Azusa who was a high school student. Kept engaging in physical relations for a little while since sexual compatibility with Azusa was great."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sexual libido is enormous, character is sports-minded. During school days, was the leader of cheering team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even now, regularly goes to gym to train his body and has developed quite a macho figure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In sex, also does variety of acrobatic sexual positions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After divorce, has been venting out his libido mainly from sexual entertainment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61902"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61907","characterName":"柳浦 直孝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61907"},"originalCharacterName":"柳浦 直孝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Son of the protagonist, husband of the heroine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Parents divorced during childhood. From mother's side took the family name \"Yagiura\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"During university graduation, he tried to marry the heroine but faced severe opposition from his mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the past, Naotaka was uncoditionally obedient to his mother but awakens his self esteem, resists his mother and leaves the house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, since there is nothing to rely on, ended up living with the protagonist."},{